  "cited_article_id": "update-practice-settings-and-locations",
  "reply": "To update your practice’s billing address, Tax ID, and provider NPI numbers, an Administrator should go to **Admin > Practice Setup**. On the **Details & Tax ID** tab edit the legal name, address, and Tax ID, then use the **Locations** tab to modify service addresses and assign new location NPI numbers. For provider identifiers, open **Admin > Providers**, select each staff member, and change their NPI and taxonomy codes in the **Billing Identifiers** section, saving after each change. After saving, verify that the updated billing location is linked under **Billing > Claim Defaults**; otherwise claims will continue to use the old data. Changes affect only new claim drafts and will not retroactively change already generated or queued claims. If the updated information still does not appear, clear your browser cache or contact support with the affected claim IDs."
}
